              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Agency for International Development, the case concerns whether Congress may condition federal funding for HIV/AIDS programs on an organization\u2019s opposition to prostitution and sex trafficking."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "MR. BOWKER",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "88cbd20d6f734af8779f4db2f4b5ae3a560d8e8a203b40d695cd8af78dfff22d",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-88cbd20d6f73-0002-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 42,
              "start": 42
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to MR. BOWKER, the dispute raises questions about the government\u2019s ability to require organizations to adopt a viewpoint as a condition of receiving federal funds."
      }
    ],
