                "ev-88cbd20d6f73-0000-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 3,
                "start": 3
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Agency for International Development, congress\u2019s comprehensive HIV/AIDS program includes a policy of opposing prostitution and sex trafficking, and it intends to grant limited competitive federal funding only to organizations that agree with that policy."
        }
      ],
      "heading": "Agency for International Development (Petitioner)",
      "status": "complete",
