              "document_hash": "88cbd20d6f734af8779f4db2f4b5ae3a560d8e8a203b40d695cd8af78dfff22d",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-88cbd20d6f73-0002-0003"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 54,
                "start": 54
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to MR. SRINIVASAN, the government\u2019s requirement is not about imposing a viewpoint; it is about selecting reliable partners whose views align with the government\u2019s program."
        },
        {
          "attribution": "MR. BOWKER",
          "citations": [
            {
              "document_hash": "88cbd20d6f734af8779f4db2f4b5ae3a560d8e8a203b40d695cd8af78dfff22d",
              "evidence_ids": [
                "ev-88cbd20d6f73-0002-0001"
              ],
              "pages": {
                "end": 42,
                "start": 42
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "According to MR. BOWKER, bowker argued that the government\u2019s authority to control its program does not justify restricting speech or imposing loyalty oaths in this context."
        }
      ],
